{"seq":1,"slug":"mutation-testing-principles","title":"变异测试的核心原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation/mutation-testing-principles","wordCount":1695,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"变异测试的核心原理\">变异测试的核心原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>变异测试通过向源代码注入微小人工缺陷（变异体）来度量测试套件的有效性。核心指标是变异分数——被测试杀死的变异体比例。理论基础为能力假设（真实 bug 表现为小偏差）和耦合效应假设（检测简单缺陷的测试倾向于也能检测复合缺陷）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试套件的有效性问题\">测试套件的有效性问题</h2><p>代码覆盖率是衡量测试充分性最常用的指标——但它有一个根本缺陷：<strong>覆盖率度量代码是否被<em>执行</em>，而非是否被<em>有效验证</em></strong>。一个没有任何断言的测试可以达到 100% 的行覆盖率，但对检测 bug 完全无能为力。</p>\n<p>变异测试（Mutation Testing）解决的正是这个问题：它通过向源代码注入微小的人工缺陷（变异体 / mutant），检验现有测试能否检测出这些缺陷。如果一个变异体导致某个测试失败——变异体被&quot;杀死&quot;（killed）；如果所有测试仍然通过——变异体&quot;存活&quot;（survived），这暴露了测试套件的薄弱点。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>变异分数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>被杀死的变异体数</mtext><mtext>全部有效变异体数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{变异分数} = \\frac{\\text{被杀死的变异体数}}{\\text{全部有效变异体数}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">变异分数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全部有效变异体数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">被杀死的变异体数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>变异测试的核心假设是<strong>能力假设</strong>（Competent Programmer Hypothesis）：程序员编写的代码通常&quot;接近正确&quot;——真实 bug 表现为小的偏差（一个运算符写错、一个边界条件偏移），而非大规模的逻辑混乱。因此，模拟这些小偏差的变异体能有效代表真实世界的缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变异算子体系\">变异算子体系</h2><p>变异算子（Mutation Operator）定义了对源代码施加变异的规则。不同算子模拟不同类型的程序员错误：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[变异算子分类] --&gt; B[算术算子替换]&#10;    A --&gt; C[关系算子替换]&#10;    A --&gt; D[逻辑算子替换]&#10;    A --&gt; E[语句级变异]&#10;    A --&gt; F[值变异]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;+ → -,  * → /,  % → *&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;&gt; → &gt;=,  == → !=,  &lt; → &lt;=&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;&amp;&amp; → ||,  ! → 删除&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;删除语句, 交换if/else&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[&quot;true → false, 返回值取反&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[变异算子分类] --&gt; B[算术算子替换]\n    A --&gt; C[关系算子替换]\n    A --&gt; D[逻辑算子替换]\n    A --&gt; E[语句级变异]\n    A --&gt; F[值变异]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[\"+ → -,  * → /,  % → *\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"&gt; → &gt;=,  == → !=,  &lt; → &lt;=\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"&amp;&amp; → ||,  ! → 删除\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"删除语句, 交换if/else\"]\n    F --&gt; F1[\"true → false, 返回值取反\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算子类别</th>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>原始代码</th>\n<th>变异后代码</th>\n<th>模拟的错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>算术替换</td>\n<td>AOR</td>\n<td><code>a + b</code></td>\n<td><code>a - b</code></td>\n<td>运算符选错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系替换</td>\n<td>ROR</td>\n<td><code>x &gt;= 18</code></td>\n<td><code>x &gt; 18</code></td>\n<td>边界条件偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑替换</td>\n<td>LOR</td>\n<td><code>a &amp;&amp; b</code></td>\n<td><code>a || b</code></td>\n<td>逻辑条件反转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件边界</td>\n<td>CBM</td>\n<td><code>i &lt; n</code></td>\n<td><code>i &lt;= n</code></td>\n<td>循环边界错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回值</td>\n<td>RVR</td>\n<td><code>return true</code></td>\n<td><code>return false</code></td>\n<td>布尔逻辑反转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语句删除</td>\n<td>SDL</td>\n<td><code>validate(x)</code></td>\n<td><em>(删除)</em></td>\n<td>遗漏必要步骤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>块语句</td>\n<td>BSR</td>\n<td><code>{...}</code></td>\n<td><code>{}</code></td>\n<td>空实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量替换</td>\n<td>IMR</td>\n<td><code>i++</code></td>\n<td><code>i--</code></td>\n<td>方向错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"变异测试的执行流程\">变异测试的执行流程</h2><p>变异测试的完整工作流程如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>生成变异体</strong>：对源代码逐处应用变异算子，每个变异点生成一个变异体</li>\n<li><strong>编译变异体</strong>：编译每个变异版本的代码</li>\n<li><strong>执行测试套件</strong>：对每个变异体运行完整（或相关子集）的测试套件</li>\n<li><strong>判定结果</strong>：测试失败→变异体被杀死；测试全过→变异体存活</li>\n<li><strong>计算分数</strong>：统计杀死率，分析存活变异体的分布</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 变异测试的伪代码流程&#10;def mutation_testing(source, test_suite):&#10;    mutants = generate_mutants(source)&#10;    killed, survived, equivalent = 0, 0, 0&#10;&#10;    for mutant in mutants:&#10;        if not compiles(mutant):&#10;            continue  # 编译错误的变异体不计入&#10;        result = run_tests(test_suite, mutant)&#10;        if result.any_failed:&#10;            killed += 1&#10;        else:&#10;            survived += 1&#10;&#10;    score = killed / (killed + survived) * 100&#10;    return MutationReport(score, survived_mutants)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 变异测试的伪代码流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mutation_testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(source, test_suite):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mutants </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> generate_mutants(source)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    killed, survived, equivalent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mutant </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mutants:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compiles(mutant):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 编译错误的变异体不计入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> run_tests(test_suite, mutant)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.any_failed:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            killed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            survived </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> killed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (killed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> survived) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MutationReport(score, survived_mutants)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"等价变异体问题\">等价变异体问题</h2><p>变异测试的最大理论挑战是<strong>等价变异体</strong>（Equivalent Mutant）——某些变异在语义上与原始代码等价，不可能被任何测试杀死：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 原始代码&#10;int index = 0;&#10;while (index &lt; items.length) {&#10;    process(items[index]);&#10;    index++;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 等价变异体：行为完全相同&#10;int index = 0;&#10;while (index != items.length) {  // &lt; 替换为 !=&#10;    process(items[index]);&#10;    index++;  // 因为 index 单调递增，!=  和 &lt; 效果相同&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原始代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items.length) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items[index]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等价变异体：行为完全相同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items.length) {  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// &#x3C; 替换为 !=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items[index]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 因为 index 单调递增，!=  和 &#x3C; 效果相同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等价变异体会虚假地降低变异分数——它们存活不是因为测试弱，而是因为它们根本不是真正的缺陷。</p>\n<p>判定等价变异体是不可判定问题（等价于程序等价性判定），但实践中有几种缓解策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编译器优化</td>\n<td>如果优化后代码相同则等价</td>\n<td>检出 ~20% 等价体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCE（Trivial Compiler Equivalence）</td>\n<td>比较编译后的字节码</td>\n<td>快速但保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束求解</td>\n<td>用 SMT solver 证明等价</td>\n<td>精确但昂贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时判定</td>\n<td>标记执行超时的为&quot;可能等价&quot;</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工审查</td>\n<td>对存活者人工判断</td>\n<td>准确但不可扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现代工具（如 PITest 的 arcmutate 扩展）使用启发式方法自动排除大部分等价变异体——例如，排除只影响日志语句的变异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"耦合效应假设\">耦合效应假设</h2><p>变异测试的理论基础之二是<strong>耦合效应假设</strong>（Coupling Effect Hypothesis）：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>能检测简单缺陷（一阶变异体）的测试套件，也倾向于能检测由简单缺陷组合而成的复杂缺陷（高阶变异体）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这意味着我们只需要生成一阶变异体（每次只改动一处），就能评估测试套件对更复杂缺陷的检测能力。这极大地降低了变异测试的计算成本——一阶变异体数量与代码行数线性相关，而高阶变异体数量呈组合爆炸。</p>\n<p>数学表达：设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为一阶缺陷集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 k 阶缺陷集合，测试套件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的检测能力有：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mtext> detects </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mtext> detects </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(T \\text{ detects } d_k) \\geq 1 - \\prod_{i=1}^{k} (1 - P(T \\text{ detects } d_{1,i}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> detects </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> detects </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个一阶缺陷 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{1,1}, ..., d_{1,k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 耦合而成的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变异测试与代码覆盖率的关系\">变异测试与代码覆盖率的关系</h2><p>变异分数和代码覆盖率度量的是不同维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>代码覆盖率</th>\n<th>变异分数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>度量什么</td>\n<td>代码是否被执行</td>\n<td>测试是否能检测缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上界含义</td>\n<td>100%=所有代码都跑过</td>\n<td>100%=所有变异都能检出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可达到性</td>\n<td>较易达到（尤其行覆盖）</td>\n<td>较难达到（等价体问题）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指导性</td>\n<td>指出未测试的代码</td>\n<td>指出测试不够强的代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>低（一次运行）</td>\n<td>高（每个变异体一次运行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误导风险</td>\n<td>高覆盖率≠好测试</td>\n<td>高变异分数≈好测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验法则：变异分数是覆盖率的<em>严格超集</em>——未覆盖的代码其变异体必然存活（测试都跑不到那里），但覆盖的代码其变异体仍可能存活（测试跑到了但没有有效断言）。</p>\n<p>研究数据显示：代码覆盖率从 80% 提升到 90% 并不能保证测试质量的等比例提升；但变异分数从 60% 提升到 80% 则几乎确定意味着测试套件检测真实 bug 的能力有了实质性增长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>变异测试回答了&quot;测试本身是否有效&quot;这个元问题——代码覆盖率只能说明代码被执行了，变异分数能说明测试确实在检测缺陷。其理论基础是能力假设和耦合效应假设，共同支持&quot;只需一阶变异就够&quot;的工程简化。等价变异体是主要的噪声源，需要通过编译器优化比对和启发式方法缓解。变异分数与代码覆盖率度量不同维度——前者是后者的严格超集，更能反映测试套件对真实 bug 的检测能力。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>sibling-link</strong>: 理解了变异测试的理论基础后，下一步需要掌握具体工具的配置与使用。见 <a href=\"mutation-tools\">变异测试工具</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变异测试的核心原理","id":"变异测试的核心原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测试套件的有效性问题","id":"测试套件的有效性问题"},{"level":2,"text":"变异算子体系","id":"变异算子体系"},{"level":2,"text":"变异测试的执行流程","id":"变异测试的执行流程"},{"level":2,"text":"等价变异体问题","id":"等价变异体问题"},{"level":2,"text":"耦合效应假设","id":"耦合效应假设"},{"level":2,"text":"变异测试与代码覆盖率的关系","id":"变异测试与代码覆盖率的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结构化模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/structured-fuzzing"},"next":{"title":"变异测试工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/mutation/mutation-tools"}}